SUMMARY:Science for All: A Sensory-Friendly Science Night
DESCRIPTION:Experience the wonders of science in a sensory-friendly environment! These special events feature interactive activities\, engaging fulldome theater shows\, captivating exhibits\, and dynamic science performances. With changes made to fit various sensory sensitivities\, Sensory-Friendly Science Nights are perfect for all ages and offer a unique opportunity to explore and enjoy science.
URL:https://moreheadplanetarium.org/calendar/science-for-all-a-sensory-friendly-science-night-5/
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center\, 250 E Franklin St\, Chapel Hill\, North Carolina\, 27516\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Programs
